{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "currIndex": 0,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "Who's there?",
        "Oh, it's you. I take it you've seen the bracket? You and I are in the first bout."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null, 1],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 1,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "I came to wish you luck.",
        "I just wanted to see what I'm up against."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [2, 3],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [1, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 2,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "…",
        "Well very kind. I'd wish you the same if victory was not as vital to me as it is. So truthfully, I hope you are at your worst."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [4, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 3,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "Grace personified, the devil claims finesse is found in the hands?",
        "I'll show that it resides in footwork."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [4, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 4,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "It's not often for a ballet dancer to use a sword, how long have you been fencing?"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [5, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 5,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "In this world how could you get by without it? Danger lurks around every corner. Our royal family incompetent and crime rampant. I refuse to let the arts be victimized and walked through."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [6, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 6,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "Did you also hear about this competition through a letter?"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [7, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 7,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "Yes. A fan approached me after my one woman performance. He was the only one there, a far cry from my past shows.",
        "But now you’ll answer my question, do you choose not to speak or simply cannot?"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null, 8],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 8,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "I lost my voice in a duel.",
        "I'd rather not say."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [9, 10],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [1, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 9,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "A pity. I understand more than most."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [11, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 10,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "Of course…"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [15, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 11,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "What do you seek to gain from this tournament?"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [12, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 12,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "Like you, I’ve lost a piece of me. This mask shields viewers from an affliction most vile. My once beautiful face is now unrecognizable. I intend to see my face again."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [13, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 2,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 13,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "I used to sing. It was my first love, I understand more than most.",
        "SILENCE"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [14, 16],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [1, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 2,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 14,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "The others won’t know what life has done to our art, it’s nice to know I’m not alone.",
        "Maybe in another life I could dance to one of your songs.",
        "However, in this life we are not so fortunate. I still intend to win, rest easy singer."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null, null, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 3,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 15,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "I’ll see you in the arena. Goodbye."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [16, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    },
    {
      "currIndex": 16,
      "characterName": "swan",
      "text": [
        "See you in the arena."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null, null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": 0,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    }
